# Upload context for `gcloud run deploy --source .` (see
# .github/actions/deploy-cloud-run). The Dockerfile only COPYs devotions/, so
# everything else is excluded to keep uploads small. The native shell (mobile/)
# and marketing art alone are ~50 MB.
.git/
.gitignore
.gcloudignore
.github/
mobile/
marketing/
docs/
*.md

# Local-only artifacts (mirrors .gitignore)
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.env
*.env
